card.statement:
Assume $\hat B$ is stable.
The screening operators $S_i$ with $i\ne 0$ commute with $\tilde E(z)$:

\begin{align*}
&[S_i,\tilde\Eb(z)]=0,\qquad i=1,\ldots,\ell\,.
\end{align*}

For the zeroth screening we have

\begin{align*}
[S_0,\tilde\Eb(z)]=b_{c_1}[S_0,\bs\Lambda_1(z)-\bs\Lambda_1(\mu z)]\,.
\end{align*}
